                                                            </figure>
                                                        </div>
                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Jason Barnett</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Jason is an Associate Artist with Synergy Theatre Project and Playing ON Theatre Company.</p>
<p><strong>For the Almeida:</strong> <em>The Key Workers Cycle</em>; <em>The Fixer</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Black Comedy</em> (Orange Tree Theatre); <em>The Tempest</em>; <em>The Seagull</em> (West End); <em>The Hot Wing King</em>; <em>The Visit</em>; <em>Saint George and the Dragon</em>; <em>Emil and the Detectives</em>; <em>War Horse</em>; <em>Amato Saltone</em> (National Theatre); <em>The Winter’s Tale</em>; <em>Pericles</em>; <em>Days of Significance</em> (RSC); <em>Living Newspaper</em>; <em>Instructions for Correct Assembly</em>; <em>Prime Time</em>; <em>Friday Night Sex</em>; <em>The Victorian in the Wall</em>; <em>The Girlfriend Experience</em> (Royal Court); <em>Life of Galileo</em> (Young Vic); <em>About a Boy</em> (Young Vic/ Bush Theatre/ Unicorn Theatre); <em>Mogadishu</em> (Lyric Hammersmith/ Royal Exchange Theatre, Manchester); <em>Hamlet</em> (Bristol Old Vic).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Red, White &amp; Royal Wedding</em>; <em>Seize Them!</em>; <em>Straight Shooter</em>; <em>London Road</em>; <em>Cinderella</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>The Count of Monte Cristo</em>; <em>3 Body Problem</em>; <em>The Power of Parker</em>; <em>Black Ops</em>; <em>The Completely Made-Up Adventures of Dick Turpin</em>; <em>Bridgerton</em>; <em>Agatha Raisin</em>; <em>Lee and Dean</em>; <em>Jonathan Creek</em>; <em>Death in Paradise</em>; <em>The Javone Prince Show</em>; <em>PhoneShop</em>; <em>Bad Education</em>; <em>Extras</em>.</p>
<p>Jason has been a long-term member of the BBC Radio Drama Company, working on over 50 radio plays alongside work for Audible.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            

                        </div>
                    </div>
