                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Richard Fleeshman</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Here We Are</em> (National Theatre); <em>Company</em> (Olivier Award nomination for Best Actor in a Supporting Role in a Musical); <em>Legally Blonde</em> (West End); <em>Ghost</em> (West End/ Broadway); <em>Marjorie Prime </em>(Menier Chocolate Factory); <em>Urinetown</em> (The Other Palace Theatre); <em>Something Rotten!</em> (Manchester Opera House); <em>A </em><em>Damsel in Distress</em> (Chichester Festival Theatre);<em> Guys and </em><em>Dolls</em>; <em>The Last Ship</em> (UK tour).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>An Angel for May</em>; <em>The Gallery</em>; <em>A Christmas </em><em>Number 1</em>; <em>R.I.P.D. 2: Rise of the Damned</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>The Sandman</em>; <em>Reign</em>;<em> Deep Heat</em>; <em>Blue Murder</em>;<em> Midsomer Murders</em>; <em>Monday Monday</em>; <em>Coronation Street</em>; <em>Riot Women</em>;<em> Call the Midwife</em>;<em> All the </em><em>Small Things</em>; <em>Four Weddings and a Funeral</em>;<em> The Ark</em>.</p>
