                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">David Ganly</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>The Cherry Orchard</em> (Donmar Warehouse/ St Ann’s Warehouse, New York); <em>On </em><em>Blueberry Hill</em> (59E59 Theaters, New York/ West End); <em>Girl from the North Country</em> (The Old Vic/ West End); <em>Aristocrats</em> (Donmar Warehouse); <em>A Midsummer Night’s </em><em>Dream</em>; <em>Cinderella</em> (Lyric Hammersmith); <em>The Lonesome </em><em>West</em> (Tron Theatre/ Royal Court/ Broadway); <em>The Plough </em><em>and the Stars</em> (Abbey Theatre, Dublin/ US tour); <em>Shadow </em><em>of a Gunman</em> (Abbey Theatre, Dublin/ Lyric Theatre, Belfast); <em>Uncle Vanya</em> (West Yorkshire Playhouse); <em>Shakespeare in Love</em> (West End); <em>The Threepenny Opera</em>; <em>The Weir</em> (Gate Theatre, Dublin); <em>King Lear</em> (Theatre Royal Bath); <em>Drum Belly</em>; <em>The Cavalcaders</em>; <em>Observe the Sons </em><em>of Ulster Marching Towards the Somme</em>; <em>Philadelphia </em><em>Here I Come</em> (Abbey Theatre, Dublin); <em>Macbeth</em> (Sheffield Crucible); <em>Of Mice and Men</em> (The Watermill Theatre); Uncle Vanya (ETT); <em>The Field</em>; <em>John Bull’s Other Island</em>; <em>The Cavalcaders</em> (Kiln Theatre); <em>Translations</em> (National Theatre); <em>Hamlet;</em> <em>Waiting for Godot</em> (Royal &amp; Derngate, Northampton); <em>Americans</em> (Arcola Theatre); <em>Dancing at </em><em>Lughnasa</em> (Salisbury Playhouse); <em>The Talented Mr Ripley </em>(Watford Palace Theatre).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>A Prayer for the Dying</em>;<em> Signs of Life</em>; <em>Gladiator II</em>;<em> The Dead from the Sea</em>; <em>Sunset Song</em>; <em>Dorothy </em><em>Mills</em>;<em> Body of Lies.</em></p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>Believe Me</em>; <em>Obituary</em>;<em> Trespasses</em>; <em>Say Nothing</em>;<em> Breathtaking</em>; <em>The Crown</em>;<em> Moon Knight</em>; <em>Ridley Road.</em></p>
