                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Patrick Martins</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Patrick trained at The Lir Academy, Dublin. He was named a Rising Star in Ireland in 2023 by Screen Daily.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Emma</em>;<em> Audrey or Sorrow</em>; <em>An </em><em>Octoroon</em>; <em>The Wake</em> (Abbey Theatre, Dublin); <em>The </em><em>Great Hunger</em> (Abbey Theatre, Dublin/ Irish Museum of Modern Art); <em>Wedding Band</em> (Lyric Hammersmith); <em>Revolutionary</em> (Stavanger Konserthus, Norway);<em> Much </em><em>Ado About Nothing</em> (Ireland tour).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Sugar</em>;<em> Ancestors</em>;<em> Baltimore</em>; <em>The Problem </em><em>with People</em>; <em>Gilgamesh.</em></p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>Small Town, Big Story</em>;<em> Cooper &amp; Fry</em>; <em>Falling for the Life of Alex Whelan</em>; <em>Harry Wild</em>;<em> Northern </em><em>Lights</em>; <em>The Confessions of Frannie Langton</em>;<em> Redemption</em>; <em>Blasts from the Past</em>; <em>Roadkill.</em></p>
                                                        </div>
