                                                        </div>
                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Daniel Mays</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Daniel trained at RADA.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Guys and Dolls</em> (Bridge Theatre, Olivier Award nomination for Best Actor in a Musical); <em>The </em><em>Caretaker</em> (The Old Vic); <em>The Red Lion</em> (National Theatre); <em>Mojo</em> (West End, WhatsOnStage Award nomination for Best Supporting Actor in a Play); <em>The Same Deep Water </em><em>As Me</em>;<em> Trelawny of the Wells</em> (Donmar Warehouse, WhatsOnStage Award nomination for Best Supporting Actor in a Play); <em>Moonlight; Ladybird; Motortown;</em> <em>The </em><em>Winterling</em>; <em>Scarborough; Hero</em> (Royal Court).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>The Thursday Murder Club</em>; <em>Chicken Run: </em><em>Dawn Of The Nugget</em>; <em>Your Christmas or Mine</em>; <em>1917</em>; <em>Fisherman’s Friends</em>; <em>Two For Joy</em>; <em>Rogue One: A Star </em><em>Wars Story</em>; <em>Dad’s Army</em>; <em>Public Enemies</em>; <em>The Adventures </em><em>of Tintin</em>; <em>Made in Dagenham</em>; <em>Shifty</em> (British Independent<br />
Film Award nomination for Best Supporting Actor); <em>Atonement</em>; <em>Vera Drake</em>; <em>All or Nothing</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>Believe Me</em>; <em>Lynley</em>;<em> Bookish</em>; <em>A Thousand Blows</em>; <em>Moonflower Murders</em>; <em>The Long </em><em>Shadow</em>; <em>Franklin</em>; <em>Inside No.9</em>; <em>Mother’s Day</em>; <em>The </em><em>Interrogation of Tony Martin</em>; <em>Magpie Murders</em>; <em>Code </em><em>404</em>; <em>Des</em>; <em>White Lines</em>; <em>Temple</em>; <em>Good Omens</em>; <em>Born to </em><em>Kill</em>; <em>Guerrilla</em>;<em> Against the Law</em>; <em>Line of Duty</em> (BAFTA nomination for Best Supporting Actor); <em>The Great </em><em>Fire</em>; <em>Common</em>; <em>Mrs Bigg</em>s (National Television Award nomination for Best Drama Performance); <em>Ashes to </em><em>Ashes</em>; <em>The Street</em>; <em>Red Rising</em>; <em>Funland.</em></p>
                                                        </div>
