                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Josh O'Connor</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Romeo &amp; Juliet</em> (National Theatre); <em>The Shoemaker’s Holiday</em>; <em>Oppenheimer</em> (RSC); <em>Versailles</em> (Donmar Warehouse); <em>Farragut North </em>(Southwark Playhouse).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Disclosure Day</em>; <em>The Mastermind</em>; <em>Wake Up </em><em>Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery</em>; <em>Rebuilding</em>; <em>The History </em><em>of Sound</em>; <em>Challengers</em>; <em>Bonus Track</em>; <em>Lee</em>; <em>La Chimera</em>; <em>Aisha</em>; <em>Romeo and Juliet</em>; <em>Mothering Sunday</em>; <em>Emma</em>; <em>Hope </em><em>Gap</em>; <em>Only You</em>; <em>God’s Own Country</em>; <em>Florence Foster </em><em>Jenkins</em>; <em>Bridgend</em>; <em>The Program</em>; <em>The Riot Club</em>; <em>Hide and </em><em>Seek</em>; <em>The Magnificent Eleven</em>;<em> Moving Pictures</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>The Crown</em> (Emmy Award for Outstanding Lead Actor in a Drama Series, Golden Globe for Best Performance by an Actor in a Television Series – Drama and BAFTA nominations for Best Supporting Actor and Best Leading Actor); <em>Les Misérables</em>; <em>The Durrells</em>; <em>Ripper Street</em>; <em>Peaky Blinders</em>; <em>Father Brown</em>; <em>Wipers Town</em>; <em>Law and Order</em>; <em>London Irish</em>; <em>Dr Who</em>; <em>Lewis</em>.</p>
