                                                            <p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>All My Sons</em> (West End, Olivier Award nomination for Best Supporting Actress in a Play); <em>The </em><em>Lover/ The Collection</em> (West End); <em>Death of England</em>: <em>Closing Time</em> (National Theatre); <em>Cat on a Hot Tin Roof</em> (Young Vic).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Beau Is Afraid</em>; <em>Blitz</em>; <em>I, Daniel Blake</em> (BAFTA nomination for Best Supporting Actress); <em>Happy New </em><em>Year, Colin Burstead</em>; <em>In Fabric</em>; <em>The Electrical Life of </em><em>Louis Wain</em>; <em>Hoard</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>Legends</em>; <em>The Night Manager</em>; <em>Adult Material</em> (Emmy Award for Best Performance by an Actress and BAFTA nomination for Best Actress); <em>Collateral</em>; <em>Electric Dreams</em>; <em>The Essex Serpent</em>.</p>
