                                                            <p><strong>For the Almeida:</strong> <em>Tammy Faye</em> (Olivier Award for Best Actor in a Supporting Role in a Musical).</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>A Tupperware of Ashes</em>; <em>Dara</em>; <em>The </em><em>Life of Galileo</em>; <em>Attempts on Her Life</em>; <em>The Enchantment</em>; <em>Cyrano De Bergerac</em> (National Theatre); <em>A Little Life </em>(Olivier Award nomination for Best Actor in a Supporting Role); <em>Equus</em>; <em>War Horse</em>; <em>Jesus Christ Superstar</em>; <em>Twelfth </em><em>Night</em>; <em>Beautiful Thing</em> (West End); <em>The Two Character Play </em>(Hampstead Theatre); <em>Ghost Quartet</em> (Boulevard Theatre); <em>Fun Home</em> (Olivier Award Nomination for Best Actor in a Musical); <em>Measure for Measure</em>; <em>The Changeling</em> (Young Vic); <em>Poison</em> (Orange Tree Theatre); <em>A Midsummer Night’s </em><em>Dream</em> (Shakespeare’s Globe); <em>Troilus and Cressida</em>; <em>The </em><em>Tempest</em>; <em>Roberto Zucco</em>; <em>Midnight’s Children</em>; <em>Julius </em><em>Caesar</em>; <em>Faust</em> (RSC).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Sweetsick</em>; <em>Ish</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of </em><em>Power</em>; <em>Marble Hall Murders</em>; <em>Hostage</em>; <em>Andor</em>; <em>Deep State</em>; <em>Will</em>; <em>Our Girl</em>; <em>Strike Back</em>; <em>Little Dorrit</em>; <em>Silent Witness</em>; <em>Twelfth Night</em>.</p>
