                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Oscar Prout</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>This is Oscar’s professional stage debut.</p>
<p>Oscar attends Stagecoach Barnet. He is an accomplished violinist and member of the National Children’s Orchestra of Great Britain. He is also Head Chorister at St. John the Baptist Church, Barnet where he leads the choristers at weekly Choral Evensong.</p>
<p>He has been a regular soloist at performances of the <em>Fauré Requiem</em> and at the annual<em> Festival of Nine Lessons </em><em>and Carols</em>.</p>
                                                        </div>
