                                                            <p>Anton trains at the National Children’s Orchestra, London Children’s String Orchestra, House of Talent and New London Performing Arts Centre.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>The Land of the Living</em> (National Theatre, WhatsOnStage Award for Best Child Performance).</p>
<p><strong>Opera includes:</strong> <em>Tosca</em> (Royal Opera House).</p>
<p><strong>Dance includes:</strong> <em>The Nutcracker</em> (English National Ballet).</p>
