                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Rosanna is a critically acclaimed, award-winning international designer working across multiple platforms of design in opera and theatre.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Care</em>; <em>Broken Glass</em> (Young Vic); <em>Les </em><em>Liaisons Dangereuses</em> (National Theatre); <em>The Other Place </em>(National Theatre/ The Shed, New York); <em>An Ark</em> (The Shed, New York); <em>The Maids</em> (Donmar Warehouse/ St Ann’s Warehouse, New York); <em>Macbeth</em> (Donmar Warehouse/ West End); <em>VANYA</em> (West End/ Broadway, Olivier Award for Best Revival); <em>Blank</em> (Kungliga Dramatiska Teatern, Stockholm); <em>Winter’s Tale</em> (Dailes Theatre, Latvia); <em>Julius Caesar</em> (RSC); <em>Britannicus</em> (Lyric Hammersmith); <em>The Glass Menagerie</em> (Royal Exchange Theatre, Manchester); <em>Gulliver’s Travels</em> (Unicorn Theatre); <em>Camp Siegfried</em> (The Old Vic); <em>Cat on a Hot Tin Roof</em> (Curve Theatre, Leicester); <em>The Enemy</em> (National Theatre of Scotland); <em>Harm</em> (Bush Theatre); <em>Incantata</em> (Galway Arts Festival/ Gate Theatre, Dublin/ Irish Repertory Theatre, New York); <em>Hedda Gabler</em> (Sherman Theatre, Cardiff); <em>The Phlebotomist</em> (Hampstead Theatre); <em>The Audience</em> (Nuffield Southampton Theatres); <em>Don Carlos</em> (Exeter Northcott Theatre);<em> King Lear</em> (Shakespeare’s Globe).</p>
<p><strong>Opera includes:</strong> <em>Giustino</em>; <em>Mavra and Pierrot Lunaire </em>(Royal Opera House); <em>The Turn of the Screw</em> (Royal Danish Opera, Copenhagen).</p>
