<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Robota</em> (Schwarzman Centre for the Humanities, Oxford); <em>Relics</em> (Lyric Hammersmith); <em>The Maids</em>; <em>The Cherry Orchard</em> (Donmar Warehouse/ St Ann’s Warehouse, New York); <em>Let the Right One In</em> (National Youth Theatre); <em>Double Indemnity</em> (UK tour); <em>Cinderella</em> (Rose Theatre Kingston); <em>My English Persian Kitchen</em> (Soho Theatre); <em>The Winter’s Tale</em> (RSC); <em>Miss Myrtle’s Garden</em> (Bush Theatre); <em>Dear Annie, I Hate You</em> (Riverside Studios); <em>Dear England</em> (National Theatre/ West End); <em>More Life</em> (Royal Court); VANYA (West End/ Broadway); <em>A Christmas Carol</em> (Northern Stage); <em>Wuthering Heights</em> (Royal &amp; Derngate, Northampton); <em>The Dance of Death</em> (Theatre Royal Bath/ UK tour); <em>Private Peaceful</em> (Nottingham Playhouse/ UK tour); <em>Pavilion</em> (Theatr Clwyd); hang (Sheffield Crucible); <em>Idyll</em>; <em>One of Them Ones</em>; <em>Make Good: the Post Office Scandal</em> (UK tour); <em>Effigies of Wickedness</em> (Gate Theatre); <em>Counting Sheep</em> (Belarus Free Theatre); <em>VINOVAT</em>; <em>-Ä</em>; <em>How to Break Out of a Detention Centre</em>; Illegalised (Béznă Theatre); <em>The Misfortune of the English</em>;<em> The Sugar Syndrome</em> (Orange Tree Theatre); <em>Tempest</em> (Pleasance Theatre);<em> The Hatchling</em> (UK tour); <em>Two Character Play</em>; <em>Wilderness</em> (Hampstead Theatre); <em>HOME</em> (Young Vic); <em>Operation Mincemeat</em> (Southwark Playhouse/ New Diorama Theatre/ West End); <em>The Double Act</em>; <em>Great Apes</em> (Arcola Theatre).</p>
