                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Kate Waters</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Kate has been on the Equity Register of Fight Directors for 25 years and is also a qualified boxing coach.</p>
<p><strong>For the Almeida:</strong><em> King Lear</em>; <em>Portia Coughlan</em>;<em> The Secret Life of Bees</em>;<em> The Tragedy of Macbeth</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Jesus Christ Superstar</em>;<em> Evita</em>;<em> Cyrano de Bergerac</em>; <em>High Noon</em>;<em> Othello</em>; <em>Much Ado About Nothing</em> (West End); <em>The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind</em> (RSC/ West End);<em> Kiss of the Spider Woman</em> (Curve Theatre, Leicester); <em>Arcadia</em>; <em>The Brightening Air</em> (The Old Vic); <em>All Is But Fantasy</em>; <em>Henry V</em>; <em>Romeo and Juliet</em> (RSC); <em>Hamnet</em> (RSC/ West End/ US tour); <em>Bacchae</em>; <em>Hamlet</em>; <em>Alterations</em>; <em>The Grapes of Wrath</em>; <em>The Father and the Assassin</em>; <em>The Effect</em>; <em>Small Island</em>; <em>Frankenstein</em>; <em>One Man</em>, <em>Two Guvnors</em>; <em>War Horse</em>; <em>Hamlet</em> (National Theatre); <em>Tina: The Tina Turner Musical</em> (West End/ International tour); <em>Richard II</em>; <em>Guys &amp; Dolls</em>;<em> A Midsummer Night’s Dream</em>; <em>Julius Caesar</em> (Bridge Theatre); <em>Private Lives</em>; <em>Henry V</em>; <em>Sweat</em> (Donmar Warehouse); <em>Julius Caesar</em>;<em> Henry IV</em> (Donmar Warehouse/ King’s Cross Theatre/ St Ann’s Warehouse, New York); <em>Animal Farm</em> (Theatre Royal Stratford East).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Alma</em>;<em> My Policeman</em>;<em> Death of England</em>;<em> Romeo and Juliet</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>Coronation Street</em>;<em> Emmerdale</em>;<em> Hollyoaks</em>; <em>EastEnders</em>.</p>
