                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">David Gallagher</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p><strong>For the Almeida:</strong> <em>Cold War</em>;<em> The Secret Life of Bees</em>;<em> Tammy Faye</em>; <em>Spring Awakening</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>My Neighbour Totoro</em> (RSC/ Barbican); <em>Matilda The Musical</em> (RSC/ West End/ UK tour); <em>Hadestown</em>; <em>The King and I</em>; <em>Oklahoma</em>; <em>Dr Semmelweis</em>;<em> Come From Away</em>;<em> 42nd Street</em>; <em>Queen Anne</em>;<em> From Here to Eternity</em> (West End); <em>Pride</em>;<em> My Fair Lady</em>;<em> South Pacific</em>; <em>Anything Goes</em>; <em>Jerry Springer: The Opera</em>; <em>Caroline, or Change</em>; <em>The History Boys</em>; <em>War Horse</em> (National Theatre); <em>Hamlet Hail to the Thief</em> (RSC/ Factory International); <em>Girl from the North Country</em> (West End/ The Old Vic/ UK tour); <em>A Christmas Carol</em>; <em>Groundhog Day</em>; <em>Sylvia</em>; <em>Future Conditional</em>;<em> The Lorax</em>; <em>The Divide</em> (The Old Vic);<em> Sweeney Todd</em>; <em>Sherlock Holmes</em> (Birmingham Rep); <em>Little Shop of Horrors</em>; <em>Miss Saigon</em>; <em>She Loves Me</em>; <em>Guys and Dolls</em>; <em>White Christmas</em> (Sheffield Theatres); <em>NHS The Musical</em> (Theatre Royal Plymouth); <em>Identical</em> (Nottingham Playhouse/ The Lowry); <em>The Wizard of Oz</em> (Leeds Playhouse); <em>Bernadette Peters</em>; <em>Jackie The Musical</em> (UK tour);<em> Play Without Words</em> (Sadler’s Wells/ UK tour).</p>
<p>David was Music Manager at the National Theatre from 2000 to 2010, and Music Manager at the RSC from 2010 to 2011.</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Robin Hood</em>.</p>
