                                                            <p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>Inter Alia</em>; <em>The Visit</em>; <em>She Stoops to Conquer</em> (National Theatre); <em>Stranger Things: The First Shadow</em>; <em>The Starry Messenger</em>; <em>All About Eve</em>; <em>The Audience</em>; <em>Skylight</em>; <em>Billy Elliot the Musical</em>; <em>The Producers</em> (West End).</p>
