                                            <li data-content="band" class="" id="band">
                            <div class="o-grid o-grid--flush o-grid--center">
                                <div class="o-grid__cell u-1/1@desktop">
    <div class="c-col c-col-biographies c-col c-col-biographies u-transparent-bg c-col-biographies-grid">

                    <div class="c-wysiwyg c-col-titles">
                <p>Band</p>
            </div>
        
                    <div class="c-biographies-container o-grid o-grid--center">
                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell">
                        <div class="c-single-bio c-single-bio--link">
                                                            <a class="c-single-bio__link" href="#" data-modal-open="bio--6adca74f79d8c" role="button" tabindex="0">
                                    <span class="u-hidden-visually">Roman Lytwyniw</span>
                                </a>
                                                                                                                    <h5 class="c-col-title">Roman Lytwyniw</h5>
                            
                                                            <p class="c-col-subtitle">Musical Director/ Violin 1</p>
                            
                                                            <div id="bio--6adca74f79d8c" hidden class="c-modal c-modal--biography" data-modal data-modal-close="Close" data-modal-close-class="c-modal__close-btn" data-modal-close-focus>
                                    <div data-modal-document>
                                        <div class="c-modal__wrap">
                                            <div class="c-modal__header"></div>

                                            <div class="c-modal__content c-modal__content--bio">
                                                <div class="o-grid">
                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Roman Lytwyniw</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Roman is a British-Ukrainian violinist and ensemble director. He trained at Chetham&#8217;s School of Music, the Royal Academy of Music and the RNCM, where he completed an International Artist Diploma. He is completing an MSc in Performance Science at the Royal College of Music, and records regularly as a session violinist across film, television, pop and classical music. He has performed at festivals including Ryedale, Aldeburgh, Budleigh Salterton, Aix-en-Provence, Schiermonnikoog, and Heidelberger Frühling.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>As Fiddler:</strong> <em>Fiddler on the Roof</em> (UK tour).</p>
<p><strong>Other works include:</strong></p>
<p><strong>As Violinist:</strong> <em>Royal Northern Sinfonia</em>;<em> Manchester Camerata</em>;<em> United Strings of Europe</em>; <em>Jess Gillam Ensemble</em>; <em>Miloš Karadaglić Ensemble</em> (UK and European tours); <em>London Sinfonietta</em>;<em> United Strings of Europe</em>; <em>Manchester Collective</em>;<em> English Chamber Orchestra</em>; <em>Jules Buckley Orchestra</em>;<em> National Symphony Orchestra</em>; <em>Choose Love Gala</em> (Royal Albert Hall); Glière&#8217;s <em>Concerto</em> (BBC Philharmonic 2024).</p>
<p><strong>As Musical Director:</strong> Chetham&#8217;s School of Music; Youth Music Centre; RNCM.</p>
<p><strong>Recordings include:</strong> Glière&#8217;s <em>Violin Concerto</em> and Orchestral Works (BBC Scottish Symphony Orchestra/ Resonus Classics); <em>Pare de Sufrir</em>;<em> Dear Mr Manley: A WW1 Working Men&#8217;s Club Mystery</em>;<em> Father Brown</em>;<em> Shakespeare &amp; Hathaway</em>.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            

                        </div>
                    </div>
                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell">
                        <div class="c-single-bio c-single-bio--link">
                                                            <a class="c-single-bio__link" href="#" data-modal-open="bio--6adca74f7a21d" role="button" tabindex="0">
                                    <span class="u-hidden-visually">Anna Cooper</span>
                                </a>
                                                                                                                    <h5 class="c-col-title">Anna Cooper</h5>
                            
                                                            <p class="c-col-subtitle">Violin 2/ Piano</p>
                            
                                                            <div id="bio--6adca74f7a21d" hidden class="c-modal c-modal--biography" data-modal data-modal-close="Close" data-modal-close-class="c-modal__close-btn" data-modal-close-focus>
                                    <div data-modal-document>
                                        <div class="c-modal__wrap">
                                            <div class="c-modal__header"></div>

                                            <div class="c-modal__content c-modal__content--bio">
                                                <div class="o-grid">
                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Anna Cooper</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Anna studied the violin and piano at the Royal Academy of Music. She writes and arranges music and stories for Ensemble Reza, a string sextet based in West Sussex. She has played with orchestras including the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, London Symphony Orchestra, East of England Orchestra, and has played for jazz and pop bands including Oasis, Elvis Costello, Massive Attack, and Squeeze.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong> <em>The Wind in the Willows</em>; <em>Emil and the Detectives</em>;<em> A Midsummer Night’s Dream</em> (National Theatre); <em>The Taming of the Shrew</em> (RSC); <em>The Sound of Music</em>;<em> Oklahoma!</em>;<em> The Producers</em>;<em> Joseph</em>;<em> Martin Guerre</em>;<em> The Lion King</em>;<em> South Pacific</em>;<em> Miss Saigon</em> (West End); <em>Carmen</em> (Edinburgh Fringe).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Sammy and Rosie Get Laid</em>.<br />
<strong></strong></p>
<p><strong>Television includes:</strong> <em>The Camomile Lawn</em>;<em> A Bit of Fry &amp; Laurie</em>;<em> Jools Holland</em>.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            

                        </div>
                    </div>
                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell">
                        <div class="c-single-bio c-single-bio--link">
                                                            <a class="c-single-bio__link" href="#" data-modal-open="bio--6adca74f7a626" role="button" tabindex="0">
                                    <span class="u-hidden-visually">Niki Moosavi</span>
                                </a>
                                                                                                                    <h5 class="c-col-title">Niki Moosavi</h5>
                            
                                                            <p class="c-col-subtitle">Cello</p>
                            
                                                            <div id="bio--6adca74f7a626" hidden class="c-modal c-modal--biography" data-modal data-modal-close="Close" data-modal-close-class="c-modal__close-btn" data-modal-close-focus>
                                    <div data-modal-document>
                                        <div class="c-modal__wrap">
                                            <div class="c-modal__header"></div>

                                            <div class="c-modal__content c-modal__content--bio">
                                                <div class="o-grid">
                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Niki Moosavi</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Niki trained at the Royal College of Music and Guildhall School of Music &amp; Drama. She is the founder of 97 Ensemble, which has performed at the Barbican, Royal Albert Hall, and the Houses of Parliament. 97 Ensemble delivers educational workshops and performances at women and children’s shelters as part of their aim to make classical music more accessible.</p>
<p>Niki regularly works with orchestras in London including the Chineke! Orchestra and London Contemporary Orchestra, including performances at <em>Glastonbury Festival</em>,<em> BBC Proms</em>, and recordings at Abbey Road Studios.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            

                        </div>
                    </div>
                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell">
                        <div class="c-single-bio c-single-bio--link">
                                                            <a class="c-single-bio__link" href="#" data-modal-open="bio--6adca74f7a9ce" role="button" tabindex="0">
                                    <span class="u-hidden-visually">Georgia Russell</span>
                                </a>
                                                                                                                    <h5 class="c-col-title">Georgia Russell</h5>
                            
                                                            <p class="c-col-subtitle">Viola</p>
                            
                                                            <div id="bio--6adca74f7a9ce" hidden class="c-modal c-modal--biography" data-modal data-modal-close="Close" data-modal-close-class="c-modal__close-btn" data-modal-close-focus>
                                    <div data-modal-document>
                                        <div class="c-modal__wrap">
                                            <div class="c-modal__header"></div>

                                            <div class="c-modal__content c-modal__content--bio">
                                                <div class="o-grid">
                                                                                                        <div class="o-grid__cell u-2/3@desktop">
                                                        <h2 class="c-col-title">Georgia Russell</h2>
                                                        <div class="c-single-bio__excerpt c-wysiwyg">
                                                            <p>Georgia is a London-based violist and composer who graduated from the Guildhall School of Music &amp; Drama in 2024. She is a founding member of Trio Farben, who were Britten Pears Young Artists in 2025. Georgia is a member of Fantasia Orchestra (BBC proms 2026) and plays with Sinfonia Cymru across Wales and the UK, and with Orchestra for the Earth across their European tours. She has played on television and film scores, and often records at Air Studios, Abbey Road Studios, and Angel Studios. Georgia has worked with pop musicians including Matilda Mann, Artemas, and Panic Baby, and also played at festivals including the International Musicians’ Seminar Open Chamber Music at Prussia Cove (2021-24), Mendelssohn on Mull (2024), and Beijing International Music Festival (2023).</p>
<p>Her debut album <em>Heartstrings</em> was released in September 2026.</p>
<p><strong>Theatre includes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>As Violist:</strong> <em>Hamilton</em> (UK tour); <em>Angels’ Mumble</em> (Brunel Museum).</p>
<p><strong>Film includes:</strong> <em>Gustav Mahler Singer for the Earth</em>; <em>Dissonance</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Other work includes:</strong></p>
<p><strong>As Recording Artist:</strong> <em>Once Upon a Time in Northern Ireland</em>;<em> Once Upon a Time in Space</em>;<em> Who Do You Think You Are</em>;<em> Law and Order</em>;<em> The Worst Witch</em>.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            

                        </div>
                    </div>
                			</div>
		


		
    </div>
</div>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                                    </ul>
            </div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</section>
